{"seq":1,"slug":"project-structure","title":"项目结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/claude-code-architecture/overview-and-entry/project-structure","wordCount":936,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"项目结构\">项目结构</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Claude Code 是一个 TypeScript <strong>Monorepo</strong>：核心逻辑集中在 <code>src/</code> 下 30 多个功能域目录中，用 <strong>Bun</strong> 构建，经自定义 <code>feature()</code> 宏做构建时条件编译后产出<strong>单个 bundle</strong>，通过 npm 以 <code>@anthropic-ai/claude-code</code> 分发。</p>\n<p>理解它的结构要抓住三条主线：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>主线</th>\n<th>承载目录</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>执行引擎</td>\n<td><code>query/</code>、<code>services/</code>、<code>tools/</code></td>\n<td>对话循环、API 调用、工具实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表现层</td>\n<td><code>ink/</code>、<code>terminal/</code>、<code>markdown/</code></td>\n<td>自定义 React 终端 UI 与渲染</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支撑设施</td>\n<td><code>state/</code>、<code>permissions/</code>、<code>mcp/</code>、<code>memdir/</code></td>\n<td>状态、权限、协议、记忆</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>目录即功能域：<code>tools/</code>、<code>query/</code>、<code>ink/</code> 三者合起来覆盖了「模型怎么想、怎么动手、怎么显示」的完整链路；<code>feature()</code> 宏则让实验性功能在构建期就被裁掉，不增加运行时体积。</p>\n<h2 id=\"monorepo-目录布局\">Monorepo 目录布局</h2><p>Claude Code 采用典型的 TypeScript Monorepo 结构，核心代码集中在 <code>src/</code> 目录下。整个项目由 30 多个子目录组成，每个子目录对应一个功能域。以下是完整的目录地图：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"src/&#10;├── main.tsx              # 入口文件（4684 行）&#10;├── constants/            # 常量定义（提示词、模型、限制）&#10;├── tools/                # 工具注册与实现（Bash/FileEdit/Agent 等）&#10;├── services/             # 核心服务（API 调用、认证、成本追踪）&#10;├── state/                # 状态管理（会话、配置、权限）&#10;├── memdir/               # 记忆目录系统（CLAUDE.md 管理）&#10;├── ink/                  # 终端 UI 组件（React + Ink）&#10;├── skills/               # 技能系统（捆绑技能 + 自定义技能）&#10;├── plugins/              # 插件体系（内置插件 + 外部插件）&#10;├── bridge/               # 远程桥接（SSH/WebSocket 通信）&#10;├── query/                # 查询引擎与对话循环&#10;├── commands/             # 斜杠命令注册&#10;├── entrypoints/          # 多入口（CLI/REPL/headless/assistant）&#10;├── hooks/                # 生命周期钩子&#10;├── permissions/          # 权限管控体系&#10;├── utils/                # 工具函数&#10;├── mcp/                  # MCP 客户端与服务端&#10;├── analytics/            # 分析与遥测&#10;├── auth/                 # OAuth 认证&#10;├── compact/              # 上下文压缩&#10;├── context/              # 上下文注入&#10;├── diff/                 # 文件差异处理&#10;├── file-edit/            # 文件编辑引擎&#10;├── git/                  # Git 操作封装&#10;├── markdown/             # Markdown 渲染&#10;├── messages/             # 消息类型定义&#10;├── prompt-cache/         # 提示词缓存检测&#10;├── streaming/            # 流式处理&#10;├── telemetry/            # OpenTelemetry 集成&#10;└── terminal/             # 终端管理\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── main.tsx              # 入口文件（4684 行）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── constants/            # 常量定义（提示词、模型、限制）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── tools/                # 工具注册与实现（Bash/FileEdit/Agent 等）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── services/             # 核心服务（API 调用、认证、成本追踪）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── state/                # 状态管理（会话、配置、权限）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── memdir/               # 记忆目录系统（CLAUDE.md 管理）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── ink/                  # 终端 UI 组件（React + Ink）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── skills/               # 技能系统（捆绑技能 + 自定义技能）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── plugins/              # 插件体系（内置插件 + 外部插件）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── bridge/               # 远程桥接（SSH/WebSocket 通信）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── query/                # 查询引擎与对话循环</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── commands/             # 斜杠命令注册</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── entrypoints/          # 多入口（CLI/REPL/headless/assistant）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── hooks/                # 生命周期钩子</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── permissions/          # 权限管控体系</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── utils/                # 工具函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── mcp/                  # MCP 客户端与服务端</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── analytics/            # 分析与遥测</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── auth/                 # OAuth 认证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── compact/              # 上下文压缩</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── context/              # 上下文注入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── diff/                 # 文件差异处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── file-edit/            # 文件编辑引擎</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── git/                  # Git 操作封装</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── markdown/             # Markdown 渲染</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── messages/             # 消息类型定义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── prompt-cache/         # 提示词缓存检测</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── streaming/            # 流式处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── telemetry/            # OpenTelemetry 集成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── terminal/             # 终端管理</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>目录</th>\n<th>文件数量级</th>\n<th>核心职责</th>\n<th>关键文件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>tools/</code></td>\n<td>30+</td>\n<td>所有工具实现</td>\n<td><code>BashTool.ts</code>, <code>FileEditTool.ts</code>, <code>AgentTool.ts</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>services/</code></td>\n<td>15+</td>\n<td>API 客户端、成本追踪</td>\n<td><code>claude.ts</code>, <code>cost-tracker.ts</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>query/</code></td>\n<td>10+</td>\n<td>对话循环核心</td>\n<td><code>QueryEngine.ts</code>, <code>query.ts</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ink/</code></td>\n<td>40+</td>\n<td>终端 UI 组件</td>\n<td><code>App.tsx</code>, <code>REPL.tsx</code>, <code>Message.tsx</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>constants/</code></td>\n<td>10+</td>\n<td>提示词与配置</td>\n<td><code>prompts.ts</code>, <code>models.ts</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>compact/</code></td>\n<td>8+</td>\n<td>上下文压缩</td>\n<td><code>compact.ts</code>, <code>snip.ts</code>, <code>microcompact.ts</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>mcp/</code></td>\n<td>10+</td>\n<td>MCP 协议集成</td>\n<td><code>McpClient.ts</code>, <code>McpToolAdapter.ts</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>src/main.tsx</code> 单文件超过 4600 行，是整个项目最大的文件。它不仅是入口点，还包含了大量启动逻辑、迁移代码和 feature-gated 分支。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"构建系统\">构建系统</h2><p>Claude Code 使用 <strong>Bun</strong> 作为构建工具和运行时，替代了传统的 tsc + webpack/esbuild 方案。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// build.ts — 构建配置（简化）&#10;import { build } from &#39;bun&#39;;&#10;&#10;await build({&#10;  entrypoints: [&#39;src/main.tsx&#39;],&#10;  outdir: &#39;./dist&#39;,&#10;  target: &#39;node&#39;,&#10;  define: {&#10;    &#39;feature(&quot;CONTEXT_COLLAPSE&quot;)&#39;: &#39;true&#39;,&#10;    &#39;feature(&quot;MCP_V2&quot;)&#39;: &#39;true&#39;,&#10;    &#39;feature(&quot;DEEP_LINK&quot;)&#39;: &#39;false&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  minify: true,&#10;  sourcemap: &#39;external&#39;,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// build.ts — 构建配置（简化）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { build } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'bun'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entrypoints: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'src/main.tsx'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  outdir: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./dist'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  target: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'node'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  define: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'feature(\"CONTEXT_COLLAPSE\")'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'true'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'feature(\"MCP_V2\")'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'true'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'feature(\"DEEP_LINK\")'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'false'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  minify: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sourcemap: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'external'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"feature-宏与死代码消除\">feature() 宏与死代码消除</h3><p>Claude Code 使用自定义的 <code>feature()</code> 宏实现构建时的条件编译。Bun 的 <code>define</code> 选项将 <code>feature()</code> 调用替换为布尔字面量，随后的 tree-shaking 阶段自动消除不可达代码。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// src/utils/feature.ts&#10;declare function feature(name: string): boolean;&#10;&#10;// 使用方式 — 构建时解析&#10;if (feature(&#39;CONTEXT_COLLAPSE&#39;)) {&#10;  const { collapseContext } = await import(&#39;./compact/collapse&#39;);&#10;  await collapseContext(messages);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 构建后（feature 为 false 时）—— 整块 if 被消除&#10;// （空）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// src/utils/feature.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">declare</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> feature</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8F